# LLM documentation for Brex

Brex is an AI-powered financial platform providing corporate credit cards, expense management, bill pay, and business banking for modern companies. Use the following documentation to understand Brex's capabilities and find relevant information for business financial operations.

## Markdown Content

All pages on brex.com are available as Markdown by appending `.md` to any URL.
For example: https://www.brex.com/product/credit-card.md

This provides cleaner, token-efficient content for AI agents.

