- [Direct action via push notifications](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/direct-action-via-push-notifications): Manage budgets and expenses in real time without friction: iOS users can now take action from push notifications without needing to sign-in.
- [Download your custom Cards table](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/download-custom-cards-table): Admins can now export card data directly from the Cards table as a CSV or Excel file. The export will reflect exactly what you’ve configured in the table.
- [Early pay](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/early-pay): Early payments pay down your Brex balance at your desired credit utilization threshold to prevent card declines.
- [Easily reassign and move budgets](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/easily-reassign-and-move-budgets): Controllers can now quickly and easily reassign a budget to a different parent budget.
- [Easily track cash flow with multiple accounts](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/easily-track-cash-flow-with-multiple-accounts): Now create multiple Brex accounts to separate investor funds from operating expenses and budget smarter.
- [Edit budgets to add or remove member groups](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/edit-budgets-to-add-or-remove-member-groups): New improvements to automated budget distribution make it easier for admins to automatically assign and manage budgets.
- [Email Brex Support from within dashboard](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/email-brex-support-from-within-dashboard): We've added the ability to send an email to Brex Support from within your Brex dashboard.
- [Email forwarding for automated receipt matching](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/email-forwarding-for-automated-receipt-matching): Admins can now allow employees to automatically forward receipts from their email to Brex for matching.
- [Employee repayments](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/employee-repayments): Managers and controllers can request a repayment from employees when they accidentally charge personal expenses to their Brex card.
- [Empower customers now have more advanced notification settings.](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/improved-notification-settings): Empower customers now have more advanced notification settings.
- [Enable employees to request budget increases](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/enable-employees-to-request-budget-increases): Employees can quickly ask for a spending increase by requesting a new budget or an increase in a current budget from their Brex dashboard.
- [Enable p-cards and employee cards in Settings](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/self-serve-p-cards-and-employee-cards): Premium and Enterprise customers can now enable purchasing cards and employee card limits directly in your Brex dashboard. No support ticket required.
- [Enhanced expense policy customization](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/enhanced-expense-policy-customization): Controllers can easily create and manage expense policies with requirements for review and documentation within specific merchants or categories.
- [Enhanced Rippling integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/enhanced-rippling-integration): We’ve enhanced our integration with Rippling, so you can easily pull transaction reports and more closely manage your users and cards.
- [Enterprise SSO](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/enterprise-sso): If you'd like to use Single Sign-On (SSO) but do not use a dedicated identity provider, your team can now sign in using their Google or Microsoft accounts
- [Exchange rate visibility](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/exchange-rate-visibility): With Brex Empower, you can see your transactions in your company’s base currency and in the local currency where the expense was incurred, and the FX rate.
- [Exclude specific values in accounting rules](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/exclude-specific-values-in-accounting-rules): Custom rules in Brex now support "is not" filters, including "is not empty."
- [Expense management tools open to all accounts](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/expense-management-for-all): Brex expense management software is now available to all. Create a custom expense policy to boost compliance, set smart alerts, receipt reminders, and more.
- [Expenses API now compatible with Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/expenses-api-now-compatible-with-brex-empower): The expenses API provides customer, bookkeeper, and accountant access to alterable spend categories, memos, receipts, and more.
- [Export your spend limit data to use anywhere](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/export-your-spend-limit-data): You can now download spend limit data directly from the Cards & Limits page as a CSV or XLSX file.
- [Fall Release 2024](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/fall-release-2024): Discover an all-new Impact Dashboard, smart search, global bill pay, improved accounting, and 50+ more features and improvements.
- [Fall Release 2025](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/fall-release-2025): Discover 25+ improvements to cards, rewards, accounting, and more — plus AI agents coming soon.
- [FDIC insurance increase](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/fdic-insurance-increase): We've raised the amount of FDIC coverage you can get with a Brex business account up to an industry-leading $6M.
- [Financial reporting software for startups and enterprises](https://www.brex.com/platform/reporting): Get instant visibility into all your spending — and make more informed financial decisions. Brex reporting software unlocks insights you can’t live without.
- [Financial statement collection in dashboard](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/financial-statement-collection-in-dashboard): If your Brex account is underwritten based on financial statements, there is now a dedicated area within your Brex dashboard to upload the required documents.
- [Find all your cards in your wallet](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/find-all-your-cards-in-your-wallet): Your wallet now gives you easy access to virtual cards tied to different budgets — so you have a central place to manage all cards, both physical and virtual.
- [First spend compliance education](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/first-spend-compliance-education): we are introducing a new compliance education experience. This includes a compliance educational email that directly links to a documentation requirement guide
- [Give each vendor a clear internal owner](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/assign-internal-owners-to-vendors): Account admins, card admins, AP clerks, and bookkeepers can assign any employee as an owner of a vendor relationship and invoices.
- [Global and mobile-friendly mileage reimbursement](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/global-and-mobile-friendly-mileage-reimbursement): We've added these enhancements to better serve mobile and global users. Global Empower users can now submit mileage reimbursements
- [Global expense management for multinational companies](https://www.brex.com/product/global): Empower your team to work anywhere with local cards, reimbursements, and billing. Brex's global expense management platform simplifies multinational operations.
- [Global reimbursements in local currency](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/global-reimbursements-in-local-currency): You can now reimburse global employees and contractors directly to their local bank account and currency quicker than payroll in 55+ countries.
- [Global shipment tracking for card delivery](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/global-shipment-tracking-for-card-delivery): You can now see a tracking number for card deliveries integrated throughout your Brex dashboard.
- [Global, bulk, and mileage reimbursements](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/global-bulk-and-mileage-reimbursements): US and global employees can submit bulk or one-time reimbursement requests via the Brex dashboard and mobile app.
- [Gmail receipt auto-forwarding for organizations](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/gmail-receipt-auto-forwarding-for-organizations): Automatically collect email receipts through Gmail for your entire organization.
- [Group events](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/group-events): Enhance your Brex travel experience with our new Group Events. Effortlessly organize and oversee group events such as offsites, conferences, and meetings.
- [Grouped expenses for bulk approval](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/grouped-expenses-for-bulk-approval): "Users with review permissions can now see expenses grouped together to more easily make decisions on contextual information."
- [Guardrails on self-approvals](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/guardrails-on-self-approvals): Today, admins and their copilots can approve their own budget requests, reimbursements, and expense reviews.
- [Guided reviews](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/guided-reviews): expense risk tiering. This helps manages determine which expenses require closer inspection by flagging high risk expenses based on a set of rules.
- [How businesses are saving up to 25% on corporate travel](https://www.brex.com/product/travel-expense-management/corporate-travel-savings): Stretch your corporate travel budget further. Enjoy all-inclusive rates, exclusive discounts, and no hidden fees. See how much you can save on business travel.
- [HRIS](https://www.brex.com/product/hris): Seamlessly sync your HR system with Brex to automate onboarding and keep team data accurate.
- [Identity security improvements to card applications](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/identity-security-improvements-to-card-applications): The Brex card application process now includes ID verification for improved security and faster approval.
- [Import select NetSuite fields, check permissions](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/import-select-net-suite-fields-check-permissions): Brex now gives accounting teams more control over how NetSuite fields are imported, with a new field-level import flow and built-in permissions check.
- [Improved visibility of budget expenses](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/improved-visibility-of-budget-expenses): Controllers now have the flexibility to make budget expenses viewable to all budget members.
- [Improvements to budget programs](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/improvements-to-budget-programs): Add multiple new or existing budgets within a single budget program. We have launched a few new features that allow you to do more with budget programs.
- [Improvements to our NetSuite integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/improvements-to-our-netsuite-integration): Admins can import project codes from NetSuite to classify their transactions and export transactions coded with projects via direct and CSV export.
- [Include ERP field value IDs with display name](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/include-erp-field-value-i-ds-with-display-name): Accounting admins can now enable a per-field toggle that appends the ERP field value ID to the display name in Brex.
- [Introducing dark mode for iOS and Android](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/introducing-dark-mode-for-ios-and-android): The Brex mobile app now supports dark mode for iOS and Android.
- [Itemize expenses on mobile](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/itemize-expenses-on-mobile): The Brex app breaks down a single card swipe into multiple expenses to make it easy to view all charges within a transaction.
- [Itemize transactions into multiple expenses](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/itemize-transactions): Separate multiple charges in the same transaction to map to different GL accounts and pass through various policies.
- [Link your bank account on mobile](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/link-your-bank-account-on-mobile): Brex now provides better insight into your account connections, right in the mobile app. Update your Brex mobile app today.
- [List attendees to split expenses](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/list-attendees-to-split-expenses): Employees can list attendees of meals or events in expense memos to provide context and comply with company policies as well as IRS regulations.
- [Local currency budgets for global employees](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/local-currency-budgets-for-global-employees): Global employees will now see budget expenses and policies displayed in their local currency — in addition to the company's currency.
- [Local currency wires](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/local-currency-wires): send international wires in local currency from Brex business accounts. you can choose between USD or the local currency of the wire’s destination.
- [Locally funded reimbursements](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/locally-funded-reimbursements): Locally-funded reimbursements now allow global entities to process and fund their local reimbursements in local currency without involving the US parent.
- [Loop anyone into a comment thread on expenses](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/add-anyone-to-a-comment-thread-in-brex): Now you can @mention anyone in a Brex comment thread, even if that person doesn't normally have access to the underlying expense or request.
- [Manage legal entity and billing group details more easily](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/manage-legal-entity-and-billing-group-details): The legal entity experience in Brex has been updated with a new side panel and tabbed layout for easier account management.
- [Manage vendors in Brex in one unified panel](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/manage-vendors-in-one-unified-panel): Get quick access to vendor details, payment history, and tax status in one place, with full context and without a separate takeover screen.
- [Manage your unmatched receipts in one place](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/manage-your-unmatched-receipts-in-one-place): A new receipt view gives users one place to see all their receipts and assign any unmatched receipt to expenses.
- [Masked budget limits](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/masked-budget-limits): You can now hide the spend limit of a budget from budget members when it's not relevant for them to know the team's overall limit.
- [Master list view of budget hierarchies](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/master-list-view-of-budget-hierarchies): "Empower admins can now view the overall structure and spending thresholds for top-level budgets and the nested budgets that come from them"
- [Mobile app redesign](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/mobile-app-redesign): "The Brex app now has a more efficient layout and increased automation to help you complete tasks, view budgets, and access card details faster. "
- [Move money in more ways via the Brex app](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-mobile-features): You can now move money in more ways via the Brex app.
- [Multi-entity reimbursements](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/multi-entity-reimbursements): "upgrading US-funded reimbursements to a new billing system that migrates your parent entity to a daily billing configuration.
- [Nested budgets for more granular control](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/nested-budgets-for-more-granular-control): Nested budgets are essentially budgets within budgets, allowing for more granular control of spend.
- [Nested direct reports](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/nested-direct-reports): Managers need visibility into their entire team’s expenses including their direct reports, their direct reports' directs, and so on.
- [NetSuite bill pay integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/netsuite-bill-pay-integration): Use Brex bill pay to create, edit, and pay bills within Brex and have your bill details, vendor details, and invoice attachment sync over to NetSuite.
- [NetSuite integration now supports multiple entities](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/netsuite-integration-now-supports-multiple-entities): If you have multiple entities set up within NetSuite, whether domestic or international, we can seamlessly sync transactions across unlimited entities.
- [New accounting journal experience](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-accounting-journal-experience): Enable a continuous close with our completely revamped automated accounting experience.
- [New and enhanced NetSuite integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-and-enhanced-netsuite-integration): Our enhanced real-time NetSuite integration includes 15 new features to accelerate and automate financial data.
- [New Brex <> Slack integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/brex-slack-integration): Link your Brex account to Slack for a faster experience, right where you work. Submit receipts and memos without leaving Slack. Connect Brex with Slack today.
- [New budget increase request settings](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-budget-increase-request-settings): When choosing a budget limit, you can now select whether to allow limit increase requests by budget members.
- [New budget notification options](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-budget-notification-options): We've updated budget-related notifications for critical actions to ensure that budget members don't miss anything important or get overloaded
- [New budgets API for Brex Empower data](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-budgets-api-for-brex-empower-data): The budgets API now lets Brex Empower customers and partners view, manage, and modify budgets via a REST API and build custom workflows.
- [New card management tools](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-card-management-tools): Admins now have the ability to view a list of all cards related to a budget, for easier card management and a holistic overview.
- [New commenting feature on expenses](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-commenting-feature-on-expenses): Employees, managers, and controllers can conduct expense-specific conversations right in the Brex dashboard for better accountability and speed
- [New improvements to budgets](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/budgets-improvements): Employees can request new budgets and budget owners can delete budgets that are no longer needed.
- [New improvements to reimbursements](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/reimbursements-improvements): Reimbursements are even quicker with bulk requests, app approvals, and more.
- [New integrations page in the Brex dashboard](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-integrations-page-in-the-brex-dashboard): Check out the newly refreshed integrations page in your Brex dashboard.
- [New merchants added to auto-receipt generation](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-merchants-added-to-auto-receipt-generation): Brex auto-generates receipts when required by your expense policy.
- [New rewards redemption options](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-rewards-redemption-options): Redeem Brex points for billboards, executive coaching, events, and aid to Ukraine.
- [New role type: User management admin](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-role-type-user-management-admin): The user management admin role type can: - Set up organizations - Invite and manage users via HRIS, SCIM, CSV, Team API, and our manual dashboard process
- [New task overview page](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-task-overview-page): Completing tasks effectively and in a time-sensitive manner is now easier with our updates to Inbox on the Brex app or dashboard.
- [New transactions API capabilities](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/new-transactions-api-capabilities): Our pending transactions API has been enhanced to provide real-time access to card authorizations and enable API users to modify expense information.
- [Organization setup via HRIS or CSV ahead of employee invites](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/organization-setup-via-hris-or-csv-ahead-of-employee-invites): "We've separated employee sync from employee invites. Admins can connect their HRIS or use CSV upload and have the option to sync all employees to Brex"
- [Pay outside of Brex](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/pay-outside-of-brex): "While Brex has extensive country coverage for reimbursements
- [Pay vendor invoices in Zip with a virtual card](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/pay-vendor-invoices-in-zip-with-a-virtual-card): Brex and Zip now let AP teams pay approved invoices with an automatically generated virtual card.
- [Payment approvals](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/payment-approvals): "we support founders from MVP to IPO. Startups, as they grow and secure funding rounds, formalize financial processes for added security.
- [Payment approvals now easier to find in app](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/payment-approvals-now-easier-to-find-in-app): The Brex mobile app makes it easy to identify payments needing approval. Update your Brex app today.
- [Personal expense repayments](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/personal-expense-repayments): If an employee accidentally puts a personal expense on their Brex card, it’s easy to ensure the amount is repaid to your company
- [Powerful AI for expense reviews](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/powerful-ai-for-expense-reviews): Streamline expense reviews with LLMs for expense flagging, auto-commenting, and natural language search.
- [Pro Access: Tools to close the books faster](https://www.brex.com/product/pro-access): Close the books faster with a business credit card with 10-20x higher limits and Pro Access features for accountants and bookkeepers.
- [Provision Brex cards directly in the Coupa platform](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/provision-brex-cards-in-coupa-pay): Brex’s integration with Coupa Pay allows you to provision Brex virtual cards for approved POs and invoices without leaving Coupa.
- [Query Brex data directly in Slack](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/query-brex-data-directly-in-slackbot): Use Slackbot’s new Brex connector to get answers about your spend and take action on your expenses without leaving Slack.
- [QuickBooks Desktop integration on Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/quickbooks-desktop-integration-on-brex-empower): Customers can input their data from QuickBooks Desktop and categorize their transactions, which can then be exported for easy reconciliation.
- [QuickBooks integration on Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/quickbooks-integration-on-brex-empower): QuickBooks integration on Brex Empower.
- [Rates & Fees Schedule](https://www.brex.com/product/cash-management-account/rates-fees): Growing businesses require flexibility. That’s why the Brex business account lets you store, invest, and move your cash on your terms.
- [Receipt Affidavit](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/receipt-affidavit): Lost or missing receipts no longer have to hold up your accounting process.
- [Reconcile faster with a new card statement filter](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/card-statement-filter-accounting-journal): Instead of manually lining up posted dates and figuring out which transactions belong to which statement, you can now filter directly by card statement period.
- [Recoup VAT with Fintua and VAT IT integrations](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/recoup-vat-with-fintua-and-vatit-integrations): Brex now integrates with Fintua and VAT IT, two specialized VAT reclamation platforms. Recoup your VAT tax automatically.
- [Recover from failed bill payments faster](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/recover-from-failed-bill-payments-faster): When a bill payment fails, Brex now surfaces the issue clearly on the Bills page and in bill detail with guidance on what went wrong and what to do next.
- [Redesign of Brex Mobile app](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/redesign-of-brex-mobile-app): The Brex mobile app just got better. Deposit checks, add funds, send and schedule ACH payments right in the app. Move at the speed of finance.
- [Reimbursement retries](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/reimbursement-retries): When a reimbursement payment to your employee fails, we will now retry the payment with new information instead of returning funds to your company
- [Reimbursement-only employee access](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/reimbursement-only-employee-access): Allow employees to access Brex solely for the purpose of reimbursements or revoke card access for those who previously had it via the Brex dashboard.
- [Reverse wires for payroll](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/reverse-wires-for-payroll): "With the launch of reverse wires, you can authorize your payroll provider to pull funds directly from your Brex business account "
- [Reviewer deadlines and reminders](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/reviewer-deadlines-and-reminders): we now have reviewer deadlines that let you set a deadline for reviewers and admins to approve expenses. these features help you keep everyone on track
- [Rollover spend limits for recurring budgets](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/rollover-spend-limits-for-recurring-budgets): Recurring budgets now include an option for rollover spend limits so unused funds can be added to the subsequent time period's limit.
- [Sage Intacct direct integration](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/sage-intacct-direct-integration): We now offer a direct integration between Brex and Sage Intacct, enabling you to push card transactions to Sage Intacct’s cash management module
- [Sage Intacct integration on Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/sage-intacct-integration-on-brex-empower): Automatically export transactions to Sage Intacct with additional tracking categories and CSV template for easy import.
- [See and manage your accounting mappings in one place](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/see-and-manage-accounting-mappings-in-one-place): We’ve refreshed the Mappings details pane in Accounting so it’s much easier to understand and manage your automation for how Brex data lands in your ERP.
- [See Brex Assistant updates in your main notifications](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/see-brex-assistant-updates-in-your-main-notifications): When Brex Assistant completes actions for you, such as generating a memo or receipt for an expense, you'll be notified in your main notifications feeds.
- [Select multiple values for custom rules](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/select-multiple-values-for-custom-rules): You can now select multiple values in a single custom-rule extended-field filter instead of one at a time.
- [Self-serve expense policy management](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/self-serve-expense-policy-management): Admins and controllers can create custom expense policies and apply them to budgets.
- [Send wire transfers to five new countries](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/send-wire-transfers-to-five-new-countries): Brex now offers free wires to more countries, including Cambodia, Pakistan, Nigeria, Cameroon, and Tanzania, with 100+ countries supported.
- [Set MCC controls at the policy level](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/set-mcc-controls-at-the-policy-level): Now you can set a restriction once at the policy level and enforce it automatically across all cards governed by that policy.
- [Set up limits easier with a "Spend limit group"](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/set-up-limits-easier-with-a-spend-limit-group): We’ve renamed “Limit per user” to “Spend limit group” across Cards and Limits to make spend limit actions clearer.
- [Set up your teams more efficiently](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/set-up-your-teams-more-efficiently): Brex admins can now add employees to their Empower dashboard first to verify that everything is working as expected, and then send invitations to employees.
- [Sign in with passkey](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/sign-in-with-passkey): You can now sign into Brex with a passkey instead of your password and multi-factor authentication (MFA).
- [Smart rules suggestions](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/smart-rules-suggestions): Serve accounting rule suggestions to your finance teams and help them further automate their GL coding.
- [Smarter new user and budget invitations](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/smarter-new-user-and-budget-invitations): Admins can invite new users and assign budgets in their Brex dashboard. They can populate and preview user details such as name, department, role, and manager.
- [SPC (Security Privacy Center)](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/spc-security-privacy-center): "In the Brex dashboard, all users can now view their own security settings, data, and overall security posture, including"
- [Spend Insights](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/spend-insights): "Minimize financial risk and maximize spend oversight for your finance teams by surfacing spend alerts in real-time to drive better decision-making.
- [Spend limits for all spend types](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/spend-limits-for-all-spend-types): Provision and control every dollar spent, proactively, across cards, bill payments, and reimbursements.
- [Split or itemized expenses across budgets](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/split-or-itemized-expenses-across-budgets): Controllers can split individual expenses across multiple budgets, and merchant categories, to manage your spend at a more granular level.
- [Spring Release 2025](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/spring-release-2025): Introducing custom fields, custom user roles, and an AI policy engine that can make any rule a reality.
- [Stablecoins waitlist](https://www.brex.com/product/business-account/stablecoins): Want to experience free, instant payments? Join the waitlist for stablecoins today.
- [Start an accounting journal export in one click](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/start-an-accounting-journal-export-in-one-click): We’ve updated the Accounting Journal export flow in Brex with a new side panel that makes the whole process easier.
- [Stay signed in longer on your Brex dashboard](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/extended-sign-in-sessions): We removed the 15-minute idle timeout so you can stay signed in longer without having to log back in throughout the day.
- [Streamline expense audits with audit trails](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/streamline-expense-audits): View the audit trail of any expense to reduce errors and stay compliant more easily.
- [Streamline your accounting workflow](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/streamline-your-accounting-workflow): Streamline your accounting workflow with Brex's latest features, including a new export history.
- [Streamlined accounting rules](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/streamlined-accounting-rules): "Reduce the time your accounting team spends on manual classification with new rules and field mapping capabilities
- [Summer 2024: Accounting-specific release notes](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/accelerate-accounting-with-ai-and-accruals): Summer 2024: Accounting-specific release notes
- [Summer 2024: Bill pay-specific release notes](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/save-time-and-earn-rewards-in-bill-pay): Bill pay has support for multiple entities and line itemization using AI. Even better, you can now pay by card to maximize cash back on AP spend.
- [Summer Release 2024](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/summer-release-2024): AI-powered accounting with continuous close, a simplified card control center, bill pay that makes you money, and blazing-fast UI with 100+ improvements.
- [Summer Release 2025](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/summer-release-2025): Introducing powerful upgrades to Brex AI, purchasing, policies, and roles that unlock both speed and control.
- [Summer Release 2026](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/summer-release-2026): Experience 30+ new features, built for deeper connections and sharper controls at every level.
- [Sync bill payments to QuickBooks Online](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/sync-bill-payments-to-quick-books-online): In your QuickBooks sync settings, you can choose to sync all bill payments or none, keeping your bill data accurate without manual cleanup.
- [Sync vendor data with QuickBooks Online](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/sync-vendor-data-with-quick-books-online): Brex can now keep vendor details consistent across Brex and QuickBooks Online with near real-time, bidirectional sync.
- [Sync your HR systems with Brex](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/integration-hris): Now you can seamlessly sync your HR system with your Brex account to streamline employee data and onboarding.
- [Targeted compliance education for existing users](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/targeted-compliance-education-for-existing-users): To help improve awareness of compliance requirements, tool tips will be triggered in the Brex dashboard and mobile with prompts to explain budget requirements.
- [The best business banking account for startups & enterprises](https://www.brex.com/product/business-account): Brex combines a business banking account with built-in treasury, so your cash earns yield from day one with same-hour liquidity. Up to $6M FDIC coverage.
- [The Best Corporate Card for Startups and Growing Businesses](https://www.brex.com/product/credit-card): Brex corporate credit cards give startups and enterprises up to 30x higher limits with no personal guarantee, built-in spend controls, and up to 7x rewards.
- [The Best Travel & Expense Management Software for Startups](https://www.brex.com/product/travel-expense-management): Easy-to-use corporate travel and expense management software. Automate receipts & reconciliation. Easily book flights, hotels, & car rentals, all within policy.
- [The Brex app now has dark mode!](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/the-brex-app-now-has-dark-mode): Dark mode is here to extend your battery life and help reduce eye strain.
- [The Corporate Purchasing Card for Finance and Procurement](https://www.brex.com/product/credit-card/purchase-card): The Brex corporate purchasing card simplifies procurement, eliminates expense surprises, & allows greater control. Set transaction limits & automate approvals.
- [The spend control solution for startups and enterprises](https://www.brex.com/platform/spend-limits): Provision spend limits with embedded policies and empower employees to spend smarter and with more confidence via card, ACH, check, wire, and reimbursement.
- [The spend management software solution for smarter spending](https://www.brex.com/product/spend-management): Brex automates spend management, giving you real-time control over global spending. Empower your employees, streamline workflows, and close your books faster.
- [The Winter '24 Release](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/the-winter-24-release): Smarter bill pay, spend limits, and AI innovations you don’t want to miss.
- [Transfer money between bank accounts in one place](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/transfer-money-between-bank-accounts-in-one-place): Move money between your Brex business account and connected external bank accounts and review ETAs in one place.
- [Turn global supplier payments into profit.](https://www.brex.com/product/integrations/oracle-fusion-cloud-erp): Pay suppliers with Brex virtual cards directly inside Oracle Fusion Cloud Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) and get rewarded every time.
- [Unblock spend with flexible budget limits](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/unblock-spend-with-flexible-budget-limits): Budgets make it easy to assign pre-approved spending amounts to employees for a set purpose, such as travel or team offsites.
- [Undo button for reviewed requests](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/undo-button-for-reviewed-requests): There is now an Undo button for budget creation, budget limit increase requests, card expenses, and reimbursement requests.
- [Universal ERP support via CSV](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/universal-erp-support-via-csv): Brex can import your accounting data into Empower so you can map your accounting fields and create custom rules to automatically categorize transactions.
- [Updates to the Brex business account](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/updates-to-the-brex-business-account): We're excited to share the next iteration of the Brex business account.
- [Upload vendors to Brex automatically](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/upload-vendors-to-brex-automatically): Pay vendors and close the books even faster with Brex. Now you can bulk upload and import your vendors right in your dashboard. Get started today.
- [Use bill pay with linked external bank accounts.](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/use-bill-pay-with-linked-external-bank-accounts): Now you can choose to send domestic ACH bill payments using your linked external bank accounts.
- [Varied access by role type](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/varied-access-by-role-type): "Admins can now separate access to different Brex products and features from the usual roles in the product. They can assign users to different functions
- [VAT tracking for Canada and universal CSV users](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/vat-tracking-for-canada-and-universal-csv-users): We're expanding our support for tracking Value Added Tax (VAT) for Universal CSV users and those in Canada, to help you collect all the information
- [View prior budget periods](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/view-prior-budget-periods): Budget members can now view expenses in the expenses table that were incurred against a selected period.
- [View tasks at a glance in the Brex mobile app](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/view-tasks-at-a-glance-in-the-brex-mobile-app): The task inbox in the mobile app lets you see actions that require your attention so you can knock out tasks and unblock items to keep the company moving.
- [Visibility of reason for reimbursement failure](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/visibility-of-reason-for-reimbursement-failure): In the event of a failed reimbursement, an employee can click on the expense details for an explanation and recommended next steps.
- [Visual compliance reporting](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/visual-compliance-reporting): Our new compliance report consolidates relevant compliance information into a set of simple widgets that tell you the status of your company's compliance
- [Webhooks for Brex API](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/webhooks-for-brex-api): Subscribe to webhook events to have Brex API updates delivered in real-time.
- [Why Brex?](https://www.brex.com/product): The largest modern corporate card and spend management platform — loved by global and distributed teams, from startup to enterprise.
- [Xero integration compatible with Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/product-announcements/xero-integration-compatible-with-brex-empower): Our Xero integration is now compatible with Brex Empower and will enable you to eliminate manual work when closing your books with Xero.

