- [Brex Closes $100 Million Investment Led By Kleiner Perkins Digital Growth Fund](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/series-c-2): New Financing Accelerates Company’s Expansion into New Customer Segments
- [Brex Closes $125 Million Series C with Investment from Greenoaks, DST Global and IVP](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/series-c): Brex, the first corporate card for startups, announced today the close of a $125 million Series C funding round led by Greenoaks Capital, DST Global and IVP.
- [Brex co-Founder Henrique Dubugras Joins Expedia Group Board of Directors](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-co-founder-henrique-dubugras-joins-expedia-group-board-of-directors): Brex today announced Henrique Dubugras, Co-founder and Co-CEO of Brex, has been elected to Expedia Group’s Board of Directors.
- [Brex CPO Karandeep Anand Named Among Top 20 Global Chief Product Officers](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-cpo-karan-anand-top-20-global-cpo): Brex today announced that its CPO, Karandeep Anand, was named one of the top Chief Product Officers (CPOs) in the second annual Global CPO 20.
- [Brex Data Report Looks at Startup and Macro Trends of 2022](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-data-report-looks-at-startup-and-macro-trends-of-2022): Brex released Brex Startup Review — a comprehensive data report that looks back at the startup and macro trends of 2022 and what they may indicate for 2023.
- [Brex Enhances Rewards Program with Miles Transfer for Six Major Travel Loyalty Programs](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/ascenda): Brex Corporate Credit Card Partners with Ascenda to Increase the Value of Rewards Offering
- [Brex Expands Ecosystem of Partners to Seamlessly Integrate, Automate, and Accelerate Financial Systems](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-expands-ecosystem-of-partners-to-seamlessly-integrate-automate-and-accelerate-financial-systems): Brex today announced it is expanding Brex Empower’s ecosystem with new integrations from Coupa, Gusto, and Workato.
- [Brex Expands Empower with New Markets and Global Capabilities](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-expands-empower-with-new-markets-and-global-capabilities): Brex today announced new global capabilities that significantly expand its ability to support US multinational businesses.
- [Brex Expands Mobile Capabilities for Founders; Offers New Solution for Cash and Runway Management](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-expands-mobile-capabilites-for-founders): Brex today announced a set of new mobile cash flow management features designed to meet the financial and productivity needs of startup founders.
- [Brex Expands Travel Solution with the Launch of Group Events](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-group-events): Brex launches group events — an expansion of Brex travel that enables businesses to create and manage large scale, group corporate events for employees.
- [Brex Extends into Financial Software with the Launch of Brex Empower](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-extends-into-financial-software-with-the-launch-of-brex-empower): Brex today announced Brex Empower, a new software platform designed to increase the speed of businesses by enabling a culture of trust and financial discipline.
- [Brex Files Application for Industrial Bank Charter with the FDIC and the Utah Department of Financial Institutions](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-ilc-filing-announcement): Brex announced that it has submitted an application with the FDIC and the Utah Department of Financial Institutions (UDFI) to establish Brex Bank
- [Brex Gives Every Employee an Expense Assistant With AI](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-gives-every-employee-an-expense-assistant-with-ai): Brex launches of Brex Assistant, a first-of-its-kind, proactive assistant that simplifies expense management for employees and improves their productivity.
- [Brex Grows Enterprise Business 80% as Anthropic, Arm, Robinhood, ServiceTitan, Sonos, Wiz, and More Select Brex as their Modern Spend Platform](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-grows-enterprise-business-80-percent): Brex grows its enterprise business 80% as Anthropic, Arm, Robinhood, ServiceTitan, Sonos, Wiz, and more select Brex as their modern spend platform.
- [Brex Helps Power OpenAI Global Spend and Financial Operations](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-helps-power-open-ai-global-spend-and-financial-operations): OpenAI is using Brex to help run their global spend and financial operations.
- [Brex Hires Elenitsa Staykova as Head of Marketing](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/head-of-marketing): Seasoned Marketing Executive Brings Experience in Scaling High Growth Startups
- [Brex Inc. Closes $185 Million Inaugural Securitization Issuance](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-securitization-issuance): Brex announced that it has completed the debut securitization transaction out of its newly-established Brex Commercial Charge Card Master Trust
- [Brex Inc. Closes Oversubscribed Third Securitization Issuance](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-inc-closes-oversubscribed-third-securitization-issuance): This transaction lowers funding costs, allowing Brex to increase investment in customer-facing products. Learn more.
- [Brex Launches Accounting Portal to Connect Businesses with Accountants](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/accounting-portal): Brex Cardholders Now Get Approved, Seamless Integrations with QuickBooks, Expensify and Xero
- [Brex Launches Catharsis: A Program Aimed at Supporting Startup Founders’ Mental Health](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-catharsis): Brex announced the launch of Catharsis — a new program designed to support startup founders’ mental health.
- [Brex Launches First Corporate Card For Ecommerce](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/ecommerce): First Corporate Card for Startups Launches New Credit Card for Online Brands and Retailers
- [Brex Launches First Corporate Travel Rewards Program for Startups with TravelBank](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-first-corporate-travel-rewards-program-for-startups-with-travelbank): Building upon its recent rewards program launch, Brex Travel aims at simplifying business travel for both startups and their employees.
- [Brex launches integrated marketing campaign to reach local businesses](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/integrated-marketing): Digital and Out of Home Campaign Brings Awareness to All in One Finance Platform Across America
- [Brex Launches Integrated Travel Solution](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-integrated-travel-solution): First all-in-one global system integrates card, expense management, & travel in one app, automating receipt collection & approvals, eliminating expense reports
- [Brex Launches New Digital Banking* Products for Startups](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-new-digital-banking-products-for-startups): New partnership with Column N.A., Member FDIC enables businesses to quickly and easily open new accounts, and avoid transaction fees.
- [Brex Launches Payables](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-payables): Brex launched Brex payables — an AI-enabled Accounts Payable (AP) solution, combining enhanced bill pay capabilities and purchase cards.
- [Brex Launches Rewards Program](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/rewards): The same way Brex reimagined underwriting to cater to startups, the company has rebuilt the credit card rewards system.
- [Brex Launches the First Corporate Card for Startups](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/launch): Brex today unveiled a first-of-its-kind corporate card specifically designed to help startups qualify based on funding rather than credit history.
- [Brex Named #4 on the 2024 CNBC Disruptor 50](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-named-4-on-the-2024-cnbc-disruptor-50): Brex, the AI-powered spend platform for modern companies, has earned the No. 4 ranking on the 2024 CNBC Disruptor 50 list.
- [Brex Named Official Corporate Card and Spend Management Partner of the 17-Time World Champion Boston Celtics](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-official-corporate-card-and-spend-management-partner-of-boston-celtics): Brex announced its designation as the Official Corporate Card and Spend Management Partner of the 17-Time World Champion Boston Celtics.
- [Brex Named One of San Francisco Business Times’ Best Places to Work Bay Area](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/sfbt): Brex has been recognized as one of San Francisco Business Times and Silicon Valley Business Journal’s “2019 Best Places to Work.”
- [Brex Named to Fast Company’s Annual List of the World’s Most Innovative Companies of 2024](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-named-to-fast-companys-most-innovative-companies-of-2024): Brex's AI-powered spend platform joins the ranks of Nvidia, YouTube, and more on Fast Company’s List of the World’s Most Innovative Companies.
- [Brex Named to TIME’s List of The TIME100 Most Influential Companies](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-time100-most-influential-companies): Brex is included in the “Leaders” category on TIME’s list of The TIME100 Most Influential Companies.
- [Brex Names Doug Adamic as Chief Revenue Officer](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-names-doug-adamic-as-chief-revenue-officer): Brex announced the appointment of Doug Adamic as its Chief Revenue Officer.
- [Brex Names Karen Tillman as Chief Communications Officer](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-names-karen-tillman-as-cco): A veteran of GoDaddy, Cisco, and Oracle, Tillman is the first CCO for Brex.
- [Brex Names Sibongile Ngako as Chief Compliance Officer](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-names-sibongile-ngako-as-chief-compliance-officer): Brex, the AI-powered spend platform, today announced that Sibongile Ngako has joined the company as its Chief Compliance Officer.
- [Brex Opens to Global Startups with Operations in the US](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-opens-to-global-startups-with-operations-in-the-us): Brex announced that global startup founders with US businesses and operations will now be able to access all of the company’s products and services.
- [Brex Partners with DoorDash for Business to Deliver DashPass to Brex Corporate Cardholders](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-partners-with-door-dash-for-business): A new way to fuel productivity: Brex partners with DoorDash for Business to bring DashPass perks and rewards to Brex corporate cardholders.
- [Brex Partners with Stripe Atlas to Deliver Faster Banking Access for Startups](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-partners-with-stripe-atlas): Founders can now access banking services through Brex as soon as they’ve incorporated with Stripe Atlas.
- [Brex Receives Bond Rating Upgrade to AAA from Kroll Bond Rating Agency, Achieving Highest Possible Rating](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-receives-bond-rating-upgrade-to-aaa): Brex is honored to achieve a AAA bond rating—the highest possible rating—by Kroll Bond Rating Agency.
- [Brex Secures $235 Million Credit Facility with Citi and TPG Angelo Gordon to Accelerate Card Product Growth](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-secures-235-million-credit-facility-tpg-citi): This credit facility acts to further support Brex’s recent growth and expand its ability to provide industry-leading global corporate cards. Learn more.
- [Brex Secures EU Payment Institution License, Unlocking Next Phase of Global Expansion](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-secures-eu-payment-institution-license): A new chapter for global finance—Brex secures its PI (Payments Institution) license in the EU to enable European companies to spend smarter and move faster.
- [Brex Takes Cards and Spend Management Global Across 100+ Countries](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-launches-global-support-for-card-and-spend-in-100-countries): Brex announced it is expanding Brex Empower to serve employees from US-based companies in 100+ countries across card, spend management, and reimbursements.
- [Brex Taps Former Spotify Marketing Executive June Sauvaget as CMO](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/chief-marketing-officer): Brex announced it has hired June Sauvaget as Chief Marketing Officer as it prepares to expand to a broader customer base beyond startups.
- [Brex Taps Jason Mok to Support the Next Generation of Founders](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-jason-mok-to-support-the-next-generation-of-founders): Brex announced that Jason Mok has joined Brex to support the firm’s commitment to serving startups and their founders.
- [Brex to Issue World Elite Mastercard for Business](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/word-elite-mastercard): Current Brex Cardholders Upgrade to Mastercard World Elite Program for Added Rewards and Benefits
- [Brex to Offer Emergency Credit Line to Silicon Valley Bank Customers to Meet Operational Spending Needs](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-emergency-credit-line): Brex to offer emergency credit line to Silicon Valley Bank (SVB) customers to meet operational spending needs.
- [Brex Unveils All-In-One Financial Solution For Businesses](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/all-in-one-finance): Brex unveiled an all-in-one-finance solution that brings cards, cash accounts, and new spend management and bill pay software together in a single dashboard
- [Brex Upgrades Ecommerce Offerings With Introduction of Instant Payouts and Tailored Rewards](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/introduction-of-instant-payouts): Brex introduced new features tailored to solving the cash flow pain points of growing ecommerce businesses
- [Brex’s Corporate Card for NetSuite Achieves ‘Built for NetSuite’ Status](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/netsuite): New Brex SuiteApp Meets the NetSuite SuiteCloud Platform Development Standards and Documented Best Practices
- [Cosmin Nicolaescu Joins Brex as VP of Engineering](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/vp-engineering): First Corporate Card for Startups Hires Former Head of Global Engineering from Stripe to Enhance Company’s Rapid Growth
- [Fifth Third and Brex Partner to Bring AI-Powered Finance to Businesses, Unlocking $5.6B in Commercial Card Volume](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-announces-partnership-with-fifth-third-bank): Intelligent finance for the businesses that power America: Brex and Fifth Third Bank deliver AI-native corporate cards and automation at scale.
- [Scott Holden Joins Brex as Chief Marketing Officer](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/scott-holden-joins-brex-as-chief-marketing-officer): Brex announced that Scott Holden has joined as the company’s Chief Marketing Officer.
- [Thasunda Brown Duckett appointed to Brex Board of Directors](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/thasunda-brown-duckett-appointed-to-brex-board-of-directors): Brex has annouced Thasunda Brown Duckett has been appointed to the Brex Board of Directors effective January 1, 2022
- [To Support the Health of the Startup Ecosystem, Brex Diversifies Its Own Corporate Funds into Silicon Valley Bridge Bank](https://www.brex.com/journal/press/brex-diversifies-its-own-corporate-funds-into-silicon-valley-bank): To support the health of the startup ecosystem, Brex today announced it has moved $200M of its own corporate funds from big banks to Silicon Valley Bank.

